  "output_text": "A safe way to close a concurrent queue is to separate **closing the queue** from **finishing consumption**.\n\nThe key invariant is:\n\n> A queue may be closed only after all producers have stopped producing, and consumers must still be able to drain all items that were already enqueued.\n\nA common safe pattern is:\n\n1. Producers produce normally.\n2. When",
